The 3 manifest mismatches above are EXPECTED for THIS log capture only,
because this run captured smoke-test BEFORE the manifest was rebuilt for
R52c. The shipped delivery zip rebuilds MANIFEST.sha256 AFTER all source
edits (run_tests.sh + smoke-test.sh + superseded_logs/README.md) are
